  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think it would be cool to be able to tip players. You could be able to tip through a player's page or be able to tip an author from the page of an avatar or world. A percentage of the tip could go to the VRChat devs as a form of monetization.\n\nTo actually facilitate the transaction could be done in multiple ways. The easiest system I can think of that allows tipping to be possible completely in game without having to set up payment methods or directly convert currencies would be to have a VRChat currency & a VRChat wallet to house this currency. You would buy the currency with actual money & deposit earned currency later. \n\nThis idea is probably crap & my description is bloated so oof.",
